cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software in your work, please cite it using the following metadata.
title: auto-doc-engine
abstract: >-
  An AST-driven toolkit for Markdown document rendering, structural diffing,
  cross-document reference indexing with classified broken-link diagnostics,
  document-set health checks (doctor), frontmatter schema validation,
  readability metrics, and optional Pandoc-based multi-format synchronization.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/lostlight530/auto-doc-engine
authors:
  - name: lostlight530
    url: https://github.com/lostlight530
keywords:
  - markdown
  - ast
  - documentation
  - incremental-rendering
  - link-validation
  - knowledge-graph
